    "detailed_description": "<strong> Happy Birthday is a third person and first person 3D platformer adventure game! </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847210/extras/55856d79ef69c204c8dd15b62228e02f.avif?t=1722763758\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><strong> Act as a simple, brave and innocent little girl! Go on an adventure act a little girl! </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> What will I play? </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847210/extras/af22d6a7532cfb2e8a0d7438bff88d83.avif?t=1722763758\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><strong> You can explore different areas at your own pace. Relax and play! Enjoy a heartwarming little story at the same time!<br>Fun and cute 3D art style, embark on an adventure of light platformer and puzzle elements! </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> What's the gameplay of the game? </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847210/extras/8a38228c4a1a648858ce9c730bd1e08a.avif?t=1722763758\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><strong> The adventure is relaxing and cheerful, linear narrative throughout the game, you will play as a simple and brave innocent little girl! Embark on a unique and memorable journey!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIPS</h2>WASD movement<br>Shift run<br>E Interactive<br>Left mouse next dialog </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> The real death is that no one in the world remembers you! So before the memory of love disappears, please remember me! </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847210/extras/fad86599eec74ddf67b7d386dcd3e85a.avif?t=1722763758\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><strong> It's a heart-warming story!<br>This is a little-known show!<br>It's been a wonderful journey! </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847210/extras/309b9ab51e353bf8ae8e9992fe2ab92b.avif?t=1722763758\" width=600 height=74 /></span>",
